    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">On April 10, 2026, the Issuer granted the Reporting Person a restricted stock award of 1,250,000 shares of Issuer Common Stock pursuant to Issuer's 2021 Management Incentive Plan. The award will vest in three equal annual installments commencing on December 15, 2026, subject to the Reporting Person's continued employment through each such vesting date or earlier vesting upon a change-of-control as well as, in the event of termination without cause or for good reason, an accelerated vesting of the next tranche, if applicable.</footnote>
